Hello everyone,

Last days I tried to work with Poppr again. but I had some problem regarding loading  adegenet package.

I got this message:

Loading required package: ade4
Error: package or namespace load failed for ‘adegenet’ in loadNamespace(i, c(lib.loc, .libPaths()), versionCheck = vI[[i]]):
 namespace ‘htmltools’ 0.5.3 is being loaded, but >= 0.5.4 is required

I have read about the problem or similar issues, but nothing helped to solve it .

I will appreciate any help.

Thanks a lot

